  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-19T04:04:32.008Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My desired use case would be having a script which stores references to other scripts and calls events on those scripts based on if they have said events.\nIt would go:\n```\nfor (each script in the array) {\n    if (event is exposed on other script) {\n        run additional internal calculations;\n        call event on other script;\n    }\n}\n```\nI do not want to arbitrarily run the internal calculations for EVERY script, only for those that I know are expecting the event to be called. \nSomething simple like `public bool hasCustomEvent(string name)`, including its UGraph equivalent, would be perfect.",
